<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<title>code, kbd, samp and tt are monospace</title>
<meta name="assert" content="HTML 15.3.4: code, kbd, samp and tt have font-family: monospace."/>
</head>
<body><p>a <code>code</code> <kbd>kbd</kbd> <samp>samp</samp> <tt>tt</tt> b</p>
</body>
</html>
